\end{align}

By Applying Cauchy--Schwarz~\citep{johnston2025generalizing} Inequality, we have:
\begin{equation}
\label{eq:cs1}
\operatorname{Err}(\pi ; q) = \big|y(q)-\tilde y_\pi(q)\big|
